WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:03.455
Unit eleven. Climate and Environment!

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:11.421
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:14.876
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:19.365
Today we learn: Climate and Environment. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:24.639
Ecosystem. Say it with me. Ecosystem!

6
00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:31.953
Carbon emission. Say it with me. Carbon emission!

7
00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:39.446
Recyclable. Say it with me. Recyclable!

8
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:47.020
Sustainable. Say it with me. Sustainable!

9
00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:54.449
Conservation. Say it with me. Conservation!

10
00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.563
Pollution. Say it with me. Pollution!

11
00:01:05.029 --> 00:01:09.296
Renewable energy. Say it with me. Renewable energy!

12
00:01:12.811 --> 00:01:18.961
Biodiversity. Say it with me. Biodiversity!

13
00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.853
Deforestation. Say it with me. Deforestation!

14
00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:34.448
Eco-friendly. Say it with me. Eco-friendly!

15
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.716
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

16
00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:48.610
Preserve. Say it with me. Preserve!

17
00:01:52.145 --> 00:02:02.147
Grammar time! should / could for suggestions. Listen. We should recycle more. We could use renewable energy.

18
00:02:02.197 --> 00:02:08.342
Your turn. Say it with me. We should recycle more. We could use renewable energy.

19
00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:23.239
Deforestation harms biodiversity and the whole ecosystem. Choosing renewable energy helps reduce carbon emissions and preserve the environment.

20
00:02:23.289 --> 00:02:24.764
I like this story!

21
00:02:25.709 --> 00:02:30.807
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:32.007
Recyclable!

23
00:02:33.184 --> 00:02:38.271
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:38.321 --> 00:02:39.756
Renewable energy!

25
00:02:40.857 --> 00:02:49.411
Think and answer. What can teenagers do to help the environment?

26
00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:50.647
Great answer!

27
00:02:51.872 --> 00:02:56.487
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
